OL,3,GNEWSAWarehouse blaze at former airfield
OL,4,Aaccidental
OL,5,
OL,6,FA warehouse fire at a former airfield
OL,7,Fin Leicestershire is believed to have
OL,8,Fstarted accidentally, the fire service
OL,9,Fhas said.
OL,11,FTen fire crews, two aerial appliances,
OL,12,Fa water carrier and a hazardous
OL,13,Fmaterials support unit were called to
OL,14,Fthe blaze at Bruntingthorpe Airfield on
OL,15,FFriday.
OL,17,FLeicestershire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,18,Fsaid it believed a malfunction in the
OL,19,Fheating system of an on-site spray
OL,20,Fbooth led to the fire.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
